---

---

<section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-12 bg-[#0b2545] text-white">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-16 tracking-tight">
      Instalación en 3 simples pasos
    </h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 relative">
      <!-- Connection Line -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-12 left-1/6 right-1/6 h-0.5 bg-white/20"></div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-4 border-[#0b2545] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-[#10B981]">download</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
          <span class="text-[#F59E0B]">1.</span> Descargá
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
          Bajá el instalador liviano (~85MB) compatible con Windows y Linux.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-4 border-[#0b2545] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-[#10B981]">tune</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
          <span class="text-[#F59E0B]">2.</span> Configurá
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
          El FirstRun Wizard configura tu empresa, sucursal y comprobantes en 2 minutos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-4 border-[#0b2545] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-[#10B981]">shopping_cart_checkout</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
          <span class="text-[#F59E0B]">3.</span> Vendé
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
          ¡Listo! Comenzá a cobrar en caja inmediatamente, con o sin conexión a internet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
